#
#   block_formatting_context_3 - Layout::BlockFormattingContext: block-level boxes in normal
#                                flow and their automatic heights
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/BlockFormattingContext.cpp (lines 646-1027): the automatic height
#       of a block-level box (CSS 2.2 §10.6.3, with collapsing bottom margins), the containing
#       block height of the percentage height quirk, layout_block_level_box (static positions of
#       abspos boxes, floats, margin collapsing and clearance, independent formatting contexts,
#       list item markers, relative insets) and layout_block_level_children.
